## Root module

### `envs/providers.tf`

```hcl
terraform {
  required_version = ">= 1.6.0"

  required_providers {
    aws = {
      source  = "hashicorp/aws"
      version = "~> 5.40"
    }
  }

  # Partial config: terraform init -backend-config=backend-<env>.hcl
